      <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">

        <!-- Intro -->
        <div class="bg-primary/8 border border-primary/20 rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">
            As Famagusta Psychology Centre, we have prepared this notice to inform you about the processing of your personal data in accordance with Turkish <strong class="text-ink">Law No. 6698 on the Protection of Personal Data</strong> ("PDPL").
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 1 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink text-base mb-3">1. Data Controller</h2>
          <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-xl p-5 space-y-1">
            <p><span class="font-medium text-ink">Business Name:</span> Famagusta Psychology Centre</p>
            <p><span class="font-medium text-ink">Address:</span> Famagusta, North Cyprus</p>
            <p><span class="font-medium text-ink">Email:</span> <a href="mailto:info@magusapsikoloji.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">info@magusapsikoloji.com</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 2 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink text-base mb-3">2. Categories of Personal Data Processed</h2>
          <p>The following categories of personal data may be processed in the course of our activities:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-3">
            <li><span class="font-medium text-ink">Identity data:</span> First name, last name.</li>
            <li><span class="font-medium text-ink">Contact data:</span> Phone number, email address.</li>
            <li><span class="font-medium text-ink">Health data (special category):</span> Psychological assessment notes and therapy records — processed only with explicit consent.</li>
            <li><span class="font-medium text-ink">Transaction security data:</span> Website access logs, IP address.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- 3 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink text-base mb-3">3. Purposes of Processing</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
            <li>Scheduling appointments and managing the therapy process</li>
            <li>Communicating with clients</li>
            <li>Fulfilling legal obligations</li>
            <li>Ensuring website security and technical operation</li>
            <li>Statistics and reporting (only with your consent)</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- 4 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink text-base mb-3">4. Legal Bases for Processing</h2>
          <p>Your personal data is processed on the following legal bases under PDPL Articles 5 and 6:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-3">
            <li>Explicit consent (particularly for health data)</li>
            <li>Formation or performance of a contract</li>
            <li>Fulfilment of a legal obligation by the data controller</li>
            <li>Legitimate interest (website security)</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- 5 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink text-base mb-3">5. Transfers of Personal Data</h2>
          <p>Your personal data will not be transferred to third parties except where required by law, court order or a request from a competent public authority. International transfers are only carried out with the safeguards set out in PDPL Article 9.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- 6 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink text-base mb-3">6. Methods of Data Collection</h2>
          <p>Your personal data is collected through the following means:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-3">
            <li>Messages sent via WhatsApp or email</li>
            <li>During in-person or online counselling sessions</li>
            <li>Technical access to this website</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- 7 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink text-base mb-3">7. Retention Periods</h2>
          <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-xs border-collapse">
              <thead>
                <tr class="bg-warm-secondary">
                  <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-ink border border-warm-tertiary">Data Category</th>
                  <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-ink border border-warm-tertiary">Retention Period</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr class="bg-white">
                  <td class="p-3 border border-warm-tertiary">Website access logs</td>
                  <td class="p-3 border border-warm-tertiary">Maximum 30 days</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="bg-warm">
                  <td class="p-3 border border-warm-tertiary">Contact and appointment records</td>
                  <td class="p-3 border border-warm-tertiary">Maximum 3 years after the relationship ends</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="bg-white">
                  <td class="p-3 border border-warm-tertiary">Therapy and health records</td>
                  <td class="p-3 border border-warm-tertiary">As required by law (maximum 10 years)</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 8 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink text-base mb-3">8. Your Rights under the PDPL</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">Under PDPL Article 11, you have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-xl p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-ink text-sm mb-1">Right to Be Informed</p>
              <p class="text-xs">You may learn whether your personal data is being processed.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-xl p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-ink text-sm mb-1">Right of Access</p>
              <p class="text-xs">You may access your processed data and related information.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-xl p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-ink text-sm mb-1">Right to Rectification</p>
              <p class="text-xs">You may request correction of incomplete or inaccurate data.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-xl p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-ink text-sm mb-1">Right to Erasure / Destruction</p>
              <p class="text-xs">Where conditions are met, you may request deletion of your data.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-xl p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-ink text-sm mb-1">Right to Object</p>
              <p class="text-xs">You may object to outcomes arising from automated processing that are detrimental to you.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-xl p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-ink text-sm mb-1">Right to Compensation</p>
              <p class="text-xs">You may request compensation for damages caused by unlawful processing.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 9 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink text-base mb-3">9. How to Submit a Request</h2>
          <p>To exercise your rights under the PDPL, please contact us through the following channel:</p>
          <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-xl p-5 mt-3 space-y-2">
            <p><span class="font-medium text-ink">Email:</span> <a href="mailto:info@magusapsikoloji.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">info@magusapsikoloji.com</a></p>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Requests will be answered within 30 days. Documents verifying your identity must be included with your application.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 10 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink text-base mb-3">10. Complaint to the Personal Data Protection Authority</h2>
          <p>If your request is rejected, the response is deemed insufficient, or no response is received within 30 days, you may lodge a complaint with the <strong class="text-ink">Personal Data Protection Authority (PDPA)</strong> of Türkiye.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">Authority website: <a href="https://www.kvkk.gov.tr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">www.kvkk.gov.tr</a></p>
        </section>

